AI SMART SURVEILLANCE SYSTEM
FULL PIN CONNECTIONS

ESP32-CAM              Component
----------------------------------------------
5V                 →    5V Power Supply
GND                →    Power Supply GND

GPIO13             →    PIR Sensor OUT
5V                 →    PIR Sensor VCC
GND                →    PIR Sensor GND

GPIO4              →    LED (+)
LED (-)            →    GND (through 220Ω resistor)

GPIO12             →    Active Buzzer (+)
Buzzer (-)         →    GND

GPIO0              →    GND (ONLY while uploading code)
GPIO1 (U0TXD)      →    FTDI RX
GPIO3 (U0RXD)      →    FTDI TX
5V                 →    FTDI 5V
GND                →    FTDI GND

ESP32-CAM Camera
----------------------------------------------
OV2640 Camera Module → Connected to ESP32-CAM Camera Connector (Built-in)